+# Security & Supply‑Chain Audit Checklist
+
+Scope
+-----
+This checklist is intended to guide a third‑party security audit covering OTA, KMS, Vault, LLM/ Langflow surfaces, attestation, CI/CD, and runtime components.
+
+Core areas
+- Asset inventory and network/topology mapping
+- Secrets management (Vault / Secret Manager) and rotation policy
+- KMS usage, key lifecycle, permissions & access logs
+- OTA endpoints, mTLS, attestation verifier host hardening
+- TPM AK provisioning, verifier logs, PCR policy
+- CI/CD pipeline security: actions, tokens, branch protection, secrets scanning
+- Dependency supply‑chain: SCA, pinned dependencies, SBOMs for images
+- Container runtime hardening & image signing (cosign/notation)
+- RBAC, least privilege and IAM roles for cloud resources
+- Logging, audit trails, retention (KMS audit, attestation events)
+- Incident response, breach playbooks and notification flows
+
+Deliverables
+- Findings report with severity triage
+- Remediation plan with owners and timelines
+- Evidence of fixes and follow-up verification
+
+Notes
+- Provide provable artifacts: signed SBOM, signed proof artifacts, attestation logs and audit bundles for auditors.
+
